<title>UK: SNCF sets 10 billion peseta six-year bond.</title>
<headline>SNCF sets 10 billion peseta six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banco Central Hispano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOCIETE NATIONALE DES CHEMINS DE FER FRANCAIS</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    22.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.445   PAY DATE    22.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
